<title>GEORGIA: TENNIS-SLOVENIA LEAD GEORGIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVENIA LEAD GEORGIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia lead Georgia 2-1 after winning the rain-delayed doubles match in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Marco Por/Borut Urch beat Vladimir Gabrichidze/David Kacharava 7-6 7-5 6-7 6-2</p>
